 ### Safe vs Dangerous Overrides
 
 **Safe** — same personality type:
 
-- Sisyphus: Opus → Sonnet, Kimi K2.5, GLM 5 (all communicative models)
+- Sisyphus: Opus → Sonnet, Kimi K2.5/2.6, GLM 5 (all communicative models)
